				"type": "void"
			}
		},
		{
			"name": "RemovePlayerPunishment",
			"funcName": "RemovePlayerPunishment",
			"group": "punishments",
			"description": "Lifts the active punishment of a connected player: sets unpunish_admin_id on the matching as_punishments rows, clears the in-memory state and notifies the OnPlayerUnpunish listeners. With unpunish_type 0 an admin may only lift punishments they issued themselves, unless they have '@admin/unpunish_all' (or are the console).",
